    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d552">

                <pb facs="0557" n="523" sameAs="frus:frus1897/pg523"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Taylor to Mr. Sherman.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San Sebastian</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-07-28"><hi rendition="#italic">July 28,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Minister for foreign affairs has promised to further investigate Chaqueilo case;
                    knows nothing of death sentence.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Taylor.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
